When you fire your metalstar, your also establish a psionic bloodlink with the shrapnel still inside for [2, 4, 5, 6, 6 (TL1-5)] turns.

Each turn the victims are drained for [25, 34, 41, 47, 52 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] physical damage, half of which heals you (each additional victim healing is reduced by half).

If the victim move more than twice away from the radius of Metalstar (currently 2) the effect stops.

This damage does not break daze and increases with your Steampower.
